---
import Section from "./Section.astro";
---

<Section
  id="arquitectura"
  eyebrow="Arquitectura de Software"
  title="Filosofía de Arquitectura de Software"
>
  <p class="mb-10 max-w-2xl text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-muted">
    La escalabilidad y la confiabilidad operativa de un sistema nacen del desacoplamiento estricto, la claridad de los límites del dominio y una cultura de pruebas automatizadas que previene regresiones.
  </p>

  <div class="mb-10 overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-border bg-surface/30 p-6 md:p-8">
    <div class="mb-6 flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between gap-2 border-b border-border/60 pb-4">
      <span class="font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-accent font-semibold">
        Arquitectura Hexagonal &amp; DDD en Práctica
      </span>
      <span class="font-mono text-[11px] text-subtle">
        Reglas de Negocio Desacopladas del Framework
      </span>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-4 gap-3 items-stretch font-mono">
      <div class="flex flex-col justify-between rounded-xl border border-border/80 bg-background/80 p-4">
        <div>
          <span class="text-[10px] uppercase tracking-wider text-subtle">Capa Externa</span>
          <h4 class="mt-1 text-sm font-bold text-foreground">Entrada / UI</h4>
          <p class="mt-2 text-[11px] leading-relaxed text-muted font-sans">
            React 18 SPA, WebSockets, Controllers HTTP, Comandos CLI.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-4 text-[10px] text-accent font-semibold">
          DTOs ➔ Request Handlers
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="flex flex-col justify-between rounded-xl border border-accent/30 bg-accent/5 p-4">
        <div>
          <span class="text-[10px] uppercase tracking-wider text-accent">Orquestación</span>
          <h4 class="mt-1 text-sm font-bold text-foreground">Aplicación</h4>
          <p class="mt-2 text-[11px] leading-relaxed text-muted font-sans">
            Casos de Uso, Command/Query Buses, Interfaces de Puertos.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-4 text-[10px] text-accent font-semibold">
          Ports (Interfaces)
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="flex flex-col justify-between rounded-xl border border-border/80 bg-background/80 p-4">
        <div>
          <span class="text-[10px] uppercase tracking-wider text-subtle">Núcleo Puro</span>
          <h4 class="mt-1 text-sm font-bold text-foreground">Dominio</h4>
          <p class="mt-2 text-[11px] leading-relaxed text-muted font-sans">
            Entidades, Agregados, Value Objects, Eventos de Dominio.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-4 text-[10px] text-accent font-semibold">
          Cero dependencias externas
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="flex flex-col justify-between rounded-xl border border-border/80 bg-background/80 p-4">
        <div>
          <span class="text-[10px] uppercase tracking-wider text-subtle">Adaptadores</span>
          <h4 class="mt-1 text-sm font-bold text-foreground">Infraestructura</h4>
          <p class="mt-2 text-[11px] leading-relaxed text-muted font-sans">
            PostgreSQL, Eloquent/Doctrine, APIs externas, Colas, Mailers.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-4 text-[10px] text-accent font-semibold">
          Adapters (Implementaciones)
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-6 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-4 border-t border-border/60 pt-4 text-xs font-mono text-subtle">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
        <span class="h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-500"></span>
        <span>Inversión de Dependencias (DIP)</span>
      </div>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
        <span class="h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-accent"></span>
        <span>Aislamiento de Lógica Transaccional</span>
      </div>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
        <span class="h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-indigo-500"></span>
        <span>Testeable en Aislamiento sin DB</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-5">
    <div class="flex flex-col justify-between rounded-xl border border-border bg-surface/50 p-6 transition-colors hover:border-accent/40">
      <div>
        <div class="mb-4 flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded border border-accent/40 bg-accent/10 font-mono text-sm font-bold text-accent">
          01
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold tracking-tight text-foreground mb-2">
          Domain-Driven Design (DDD)
        </h3>
        <p class="text-xs leading-relaxed text-muted mb-6">
          Aislamiento total de las reglas de negocio respecto a frameworks y bases de datos. Entidades ricas, Value Objects inmutables, Agregados consistentes y Casos de Uso atómicos.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="rounded border border-border/80 bg-background/80 p-3 font-mono text-[11px] text-muted">
        <span class="text-accent font-semibold">Capas:</span> Domain ➔ Application ➔ Infrastructure
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="flex flex-col justify-between rounded-xl border border-border bg-surface/50 p-6 transition-colors hover:border-accent/40">
      <div>
        <div class="mb-4 flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded border border-accent/40 bg-accent/10 font-mono text-sm font-bold text-accent">
          02
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold tracking-tight text-foreground mb-2">
          Testing &amp; Calidad Continua
        </h3>
        <p class="text-xs leading-relaxed text-muted mb-6">
          Desarrollo guiado por pruebas (TDD/BDD). Cobertura de casos de uso con PHPUnit, especificación de comportamiento con Behat, pruebas de regresión E2E con Playwright y análisis estático con PHPStan.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="rounded border border-border/80 bg-background/80 p-3 font-mono text-[11px] text-muted">
        <span class="text-accent font-semibold">Tooling:</span> PHPUnit · PHPStan · Behat · Playwright
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="flex flex-col justify-between rounded-xl border border-border bg-surface/50 p-6 transition-colors hover:border-accent/40">
      <div>
        <div class="mb-4 flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded border border-accent/40 bg-accent/10 font-mono text-sm font-bold text-accent">
          03
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold tracking-tight text-foreground mb-2">
          Frontend Tipado &amp; Reactivo
        </h3>
        <p class="text-xs leading-relaxed text-muted mb-6">
          Interfaces modernas en React 18 estructuradas por módulos de dominio. Tipado estricto con TypeScript de extremo a extremo, llamadas a API predecibles y UX optimizada sin dependencias superfluas.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="rounded border border-border/80 bg-background/80 p-3 font-mono text-[11px] text-muted">
        <span class="text-accent font-semibold">Stack:</span> React 18 · TypeScript · Vite · Tailwind
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Section>
